  "reason": "Unselected older-baseline proposal, not a current repair. Issued baseline e8eeb470/version2.0.0 differs from installed approved a839ebd1/version2.1.0 accepted in review-9ff8ca4fa3be7164. Current source already validates literal integer seeds/nonnegative indices and samples broader tie dimensions; applying this patch would replace newer source and the current four-setting distance/odd_tie_side prototype. Retain the distinct contiguous projection_span1/2 alternative: span2 paints both adjacent cells, whereas current distance2 stamps only the second cell and leaves a gap. Reviewer reports final enumerated12/12 battery,50 portable/fresh tests,300 lessons/1200 rotations with zero declared-rival ambiguity; ordinary after11/12 remains an intermediate enumeration-policy failure. Alternate prototype has2 episodes/eight holdouts and canonical parity on4 pairs, only seeds20/21 and a two-cell-clearance domain. No selected source/rule/prototype replacement, current prototype increment, approval or training admission. Runtime claims remain reviewer-reported; owner checks source/file bindings only.",
